# On macOS, ~/.claude is a symlink to this directory (see ./install), so
# Claude Code writes all of its runtime state (sessions, projects, caches,
# runtime-managed config like policy-limits.json) right here in the repo.
#
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then re-include only the files we
# deliberately manage. A new config file added to this directory must also be
# re-included below, or git will not see it.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/settings.json
!/keybindings.json
!/cloud-setup.sh
!/install
!/readme.md
